# NAME: Spotify
# AUTHOR: Horatio
# FORMAT: Quantumult X remote filter (assign force-policy in filter_remote)
# UPDATED: 2026-10-25
# RULES: 30 (8 exact domains, 21 suffix domains, 1 User-Agent rule)
# SOURCES: v2fly/domain-list-community, MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat, blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script
# NOTE: Domain-only routing is prioritized for accuracy; broad keywords and legacy literal IPs removed.
# NOTE: Choose the US policy/node when importing; rule lists do not enforce a country.
# NOTE: Spotify may change endpoints; real-device traffic and account region are not verified here.
# NOTE: User-Agent matching requires observable HTTP request metadata.

